@* The card every screen puts its content in: a --surf box, a hairline, radius 14.
   The progress block, the volume panel, the profile's cards and the landing page's feature
   cards are all this. A panel never nests a panel.

   It renders a <section>, so give it a name — AriaLabel, or aria-labelledby through the
   unmatched attributes — or it is an anonymous box to a screen reader. *@

<section @attributes="AdditionalAttributes" class="@CssClass" aria-label="@AriaLabel">
    @ChildContent
</section>
